WEBVTT

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.926
A NETFLIX SERIES

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.023
KOTARO LIVES ALONE

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.866
I AM KOTARO/BATTLE MODE

00:01:17.994 --> 00:01:20.580
SHIMIZU APARTMENT

00:01:21.623 --> 00:01:23.083
Six minus one

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.000
is five.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:31.299
APARTMENTS AVAILABLE
SHIMIZU APARTMENT

00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:33.259
HOME IMPROVEMENT CENTER VIVIHOME

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:35.136
- I beg your pardon.
- Yes?

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.513
I would like to ask you.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.764
What is it?

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:39.265
Where are the tissues?

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:42.435
Tissues? Right. Hold on a minute.

00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:46.689
Okay. How about these?

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.818
No, what I would like is…

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:53.238
TISSUE PAPER

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:54.656
Oh…

00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:57.659
Sorry about that.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:00.203
You wanted the box tissues.

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:06.793
My sincere gratitude.
You've been a big help.

00:02:06.876 --> 00:02:09.504
You're helping your mommy?
That's so nice!

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:13.299
They say that starting off
on the right foot is important.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.385
Now, to the cash register.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:21.516
Hmm?

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:23.977
TOY SUPER SWORD JR.
250 YEN TAX INCLUDED

00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:31.109
You can come at me
from anywhere, enemies.

00:02:35.363 --> 00:02:36.489
Yes. Exactly five.

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:38.324
Well, then.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.206
Yes. Not bad at all.

00:02:48.751 --> 00:02:49.669
I can't believe it!

00:02:49.752 --> 00:02:52.797
I was worried why you didn't come,
but you were sleeping?

00:02:52.881 --> 00:02:53.923
Sorry…

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:56.676
I was waiting in the cold all this time!

00:02:56.759 --> 00:02:58.928
No, I really had forgotten--

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.472
- What?!
- That's not what I meant.

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:02.807
Work!

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:05.226
Yeah, I was working!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.937
I told you I'm working on a manga, right?

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:11.774
The deadline was coming up
and it took me until the morning.

00:03:12.275 --> 00:03:14.652
I'm really sorry, Hiroko…

00:03:18.239 --> 00:03:21.117
My name is Hiromi, you idiot!

00:03:25.288 --> 00:03:28.166
Girls can be really feisty…

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:33.630
I apologize for intruding.

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:38.551
My name is Sato.
I moved into room 203 next door.

00:03:38.635 --> 00:03:40.470
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:41.429
Okay…

00:03:42.222 --> 00:03:45.058
Please accept this as a token of goodwill.

00:03:45.141 --> 00:03:47.685
That's very kind of you.

00:03:47.769 --> 00:03:51.731
- 203. Nice, that's the corner room.
- Correct.

00:03:51.814 --> 00:03:53.441
- By yourself?
- Correct.

00:03:53.524 --> 00:03:55.151
Where are you parents? At work?

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:56.069
But, wait,

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:59.489
I thought this apartment
didn't allow tenants with kids?

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.908
I don't have any kids living with me.

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:03.576
Right.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.661
The landlord is--

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:06.913
I am renting the next door room on my own.

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:11.501
Well, my best regards to you.

00:04:23.721 --> 00:04:25.223
What did he just say?

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.770
He's renting the room by himself?

00:04:33.022 --> 00:04:34.190
I'm starving.

00:04:35.024 --> 00:04:36.150
Should I go buy food?

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:38.361
But it's too much trouble.

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:39.737
It's cold outside too.

00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:41.447
Because it's winter.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.784
Come to think of it,
I haven't bathed in a while.

00:04:44.867 --> 00:04:46.619
How many days has it been?

00:04:47.203 --> 00:04:48.454
Well, it's still fine.

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:49.956
Because it's winter.

00:04:57.422 --> 00:05:00.800
The prize money from that manga award
last year is running out.

00:05:01.384 --> 00:05:04.053
I need to do something
before this gets worse.

00:05:06.764 --> 00:05:08.266
Well, it's still fine.

00:05:08.349 --> 00:05:09.559
Because it's winter.

00:05:15.023 --> 00:05:16.983
- Sorry to bother you again.
- What's up?

00:05:17.066 --> 00:05:20.028
I'm having trouble.
The bath tub is nowhere to be found.

00:05:20.111 --> 00:05:22.113
This building doesn't have bath tubs.

00:05:22.196 --> 00:05:25.116
- None?
- There are rooms with showers.

00:05:25.199 --> 00:05:27.327
Wait, you moved in without knowing that?

00:05:28.911 --> 00:05:29.746
I see.

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:32.290
- So you're saying "make it myself?"
- Nope.

00:05:32.874 --> 00:05:35.418
The tenants of this building
go to the bathhouse.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.628
- Battle?
- No, the bathhouse.

00:05:37.712 --> 00:05:38.588
I see.

00:05:39.422 --> 00:05:42.091
You're saying that I must fight to live.

00:05:45.136 --> 00:05:46.804
So, where is the enemy?

00:05:47.388 --> 00:05:49.891
Not "battle", but "bathhouse." Okay?

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:52.852
You'll find a bath if you go here.

00:05:52.935 --> 00:05:54.020
My deepest gratitude.

00:05:55.313 --> 00:05:56.814
Well, then. I shall go.

00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:04.197
Looks like I have
a troublesome neighbor now.

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:08.326
It's night already?
The day went by quick.

00:06:08.409 --> 00:06:11.788
The day before she went missing,
she was with a suspicious man.

00:06:11.871 --> 00:06:15.375
There are lots of child abductions lately.

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:17.460
What are the adults around here doing?

00:06:18.586 --> 00:06:21.005
Wait, am I one of those adults?

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.217
BATH

00:06:27.261 --> 00:06:29.639
So, my neighbor came to battle as well?

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:31.182
What's happening to me?

00:06:35.978 --> 00:06:36.896
Neighbor…

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.732
Eyes. My eyes…

00:06:39.816 --> 00:06:41.859
What's the point of that shampoo hat?

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.034
Are the bubbles out of your eyes?

00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:51.619
Yes, my sincere thanks.

00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:54.580
- All right, stay still, okay?
- What?

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.000
What are you doing?

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:59.460
What do you mean?

00:06:59.544 --> 00:07:01.546
You can't wash your hair yourself, right?

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:04.465
I can wash my own hair by myself.

00:07:04.549 --> 00:07:07.552
What? So it was just your eyes
you needed help with?

00:07:07.635 --> 00:07:09.303
- Yes.
- Seriously…

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.725
But it's been a long time
since someone has washed my hair.

00:07:25.361 --> 00:07:27.238
Yes. That was a decent bath.

00:07:27.321 --> 00:07:30.992
Tomorrow, I shall give
their so-called bottled milk a taste.

00:07:31.075 --> 00:07:35.455
Your wallet will be empty in no time
if you go to the bathhouse every day.

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:39.292
Do not worry. I have enough money.

00:07:41.002 --> 00:07:44.672
Mr. Sato, are you really renting
that apartment on your own?

00:07:45.173 --> 00:07:46.007
Correct.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:47.425
Mr. Shimizu, the landlord,

00:07:47.508 --> 00:07:50.428
graciously said, "If you can pay the rent,
I don't mind."

00:07:50.511 --> 00:07:54.640
Don't mind? Those old geezers.

00:07:58.519 --> 00:08:00.771
Are your parents not around?

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:04.692
They were, but not anymore.

00:08:05.193 --> 00:08:08.404
Oh man, was it bad of me to ask?

00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:11.073
I shouldn't probe further…

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:13.409
Well, I don't have parents either.

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:16.120
I lost them in an accident
when I was a kid.

00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:18.581
I see.

00:08:19.582 --> 00:08:20.917
You must be lonely.

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:33.971
Are you lonely?

00:08:34.805 --> 00:08:35.806
What?

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:36.891
Are you…

00:08:40.061 --> 00:08:41.812
No, never mind.

00:08:42.605 --> 00:08:44.524
Anyways, pick up your pace!

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:47.443
We were all warmed up,
and now we're cold again.

00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:48.486
No problem.

00:08:48.569 --> 00:08:51.906
Don't concern yourself with me,
please go ahead yourself.

00:08:52.406 --> 00:08:55.451
I've been wondering,
but what's with the way you talk?

00:08:55.535 --> 00:08:58.454
You don't know it?
It's the language of Tonosaman.

00:08:58.538 --> 00:08:59.830
Language of feudal lords?

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:02.833
It is trending with me.

00:09:02.917 --> 00:09:04.961
With just you, huh?

00:09:07.964 --> 00:09:10.383
I apologize for having the baby
and not telling you.

00:09:10.466 --> 00:09:13.678
But! This child is truly yours!

00:09:13.761 --> 00:09:15.555
My child…

00:09:15.638 --> 00:09:16.472
That's scary…

00:09:18.808 --> 00:09:20.643
- Tonight?
- Yes.

00:09:20.726 --> 00:09:22.061
Sure, I'll be here.

00:09:22.144 --> 00:09:25.815
I mean, not just night.
I think I'll be here all day…

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:28.526
All day? Even though it's a weekday?

00:09:28.609 --> 00:09:29.986
What? Is that bad?

00:09:30.069 --> 00:09:31.779
No. Well, see you later.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:33.906
Wait. Where are you going?

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.659
Where I go is solely up to me.

00:09:39.912 --> 00:09:41.747
Why are you following me?

00:09:41.831 --> 00:09:44.792
Stop being pesky. I have no idea, either.

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:47.253
SUPERMARKET PELK
9:00-24:00

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:52.425
Hey, is that you, Kotaro?

00:09:52.508 --> 00:09:54.302
Thanks for the tissues yesterday!

00:09:54.385 --> 00:09:56.887
You're the tenant from Room 201.

00:09:56.971 --> 00:09:58.639
Good day to you.

00:09:58.723 --> 00:10:01.726
Hello. You can call me Mizuki.

00:10:02.435 --> 00:10:05.479
Such a beauty was living
in my apartment building?

00:10:09.692 --> 00:10:10.651
Are you his father?

00:10:11.235 --> 00:10:12.987
Huh? No, I'm not.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.823
I'm Karino, in Room 202.

00:10:15.906 --> 00:10:18.659
No way, you're next door?
Nice to meet you.

00:10:19.243 --> 00:10:20.494
That's right…

00:10:20.578 --> 00:10:24.957
Your faces look so alike,
I thought you must be father and son!

00:10:30.046 --> 00:10:32.882
That must have been a "neighborhood joke."

00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:35.468
I mean, I'm not even married.

00:10:35.551 --> 00:10:38.304
Father and son? We're obviously not that.

00:10:38.387 --> 00:10:39.930
We don't look like each other.

00:10:40.014 --> 00:10:41.641
How adorable!

00:10:41.724 --> 00:10:43.559
You look just like your father.

00:10:44.143 --> 00:10:46.562
Hey little guy, shopping with your dad?

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:50.733
Kotaro.

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:51.817
What?

00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:54.278
How old are you?

00:10:54.362 --> 00:10:55.488
I am four years old.

00:10:55.571 --> 00:10:58.866
Four years ago, the girl I was dating…

00:10:58.949 --> 00:11:01.827
I forgot that I'm ovulating today!

00:11:04.622 --> 00:11:06.749
By the way, I'm 31 years old.

00:11:06.832 --> 00:11:09.335
Is that so?
You still have many years ahead of you.

00:11:09.418 --> 00:11:10.836
Kotaro,

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.756
by the way, who are your parents,

00:11:14.256 --> 00:11:17.301
and why did you move next door to me?

00:11:18.135 --> 00:11:20.346
Neighbor, what are you talking about?

00:11:20.429 --> 00:11:21.764
Huh?! Uh…

00:11:21.847 --> 00:11:24.934
Moreover, how long
will you be following me?

00:11:25.017 --> 00:11:29.230
Everyone is mistaking us for father
and son because you are following me.

00:11:30.648 --> 00:11:31.857
Mistaking us?

00:11:32.775 --> 00:11:35.569
My father and you don't look alike at all.

00:11:43.077 --> 00:11:44.620
That freaked me out!

00:11:46.831 --> 00:11:48.249
That's right.

00:11:48.332 --> 00:11:53.963
He said it himself yesterday,
he has no parents. I panicked for nothing.

00:11:54.046 --> 00:11:55.214
You're still following?

00:11:55.297 --> 00:11:57.007
But I'm glad I'm wrong…

00:11:57.091 --> 00:11:58.926
You must be lonely.

00:12:00.219 --> 00:12:01.137
Am I glad?

00:12:02.722 --> 00:12:05.808
- By the way, are you a kind of servant?
- Huh?

00:12:05.891 --> 00:12:08.144
Or are you treating me as if I'm a child?

00:12:08.227 --> 00:12:09.979
That would be problematic.

00:12:10.563 --> 00:12:13.399
Well, what business do you have
in the evening?

00:12:13.482 --> 00:12:16.277
Okay. I would just like to borrow your TV.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:18.946
My TV is coming tomorrow.

00:12:19.029 --> 00:12:21.031
Let's watch Tonosaman together.

00:12:21.115 --> 00:12:22.742
You are a child!

00:12:23.951 --> 00:12:28.706
Today, all kinds of folks were thinking
that I was your son.

00:12:28.789 --> 00:12:31.667
They also thought you were my parent.

00:12:32.418 --> 00:12:33.878
Even though that's incorrect.

00:12:36.255 --> 00:12:37.506
My apologies for that…

00:12:46.265 --> 00:12:47.308
Apologies for what?

00:12:49.643 --> 00:12:52.021
You wouldn't want to be my parent, right?

00:12:52.104 --> 00:12:53.189
I never--

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:55.483
After all, I am a feudal lord.

00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:59.487
You'd feel threatened if your child
was ranked higher than the parent.

00:13:00.196 --> 00:13:01.113
Right, servant?

00:13:09.997 --> 00:13:12.500
Karino! Sorry about earlier.

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:16.754
I thought Kotaro living alone was a joke.

00:13:17.505 --> 00:13:21.675
Well, I'd also forgotten that
he told me he doesn't have parents…

00:13:21.759 --> 00:13:24.136
Oh yeah? But it's good you were wrong.

00:13:27.348 --> 00:13:28.724
Was it good?

00:13:29.934 --> 00:13:34.939
It might've be fine from my point of view,
but I wonder how it is for him.

00:13:37.191 --> 00:13:41.570
I somehow can't honestly say
that I feel good about it…

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.375
Here you go, Miki.

00:13:54.458 --> 00:13:56.460
Your results this month were great again.

00:13:56.544 --> 00:13:58.337
Please keep it up.

00:13:58.921 --> 00:14:00.589
Thank you, sir.

00:14:05.886 --> 00:14:08.097
ARE YOU OFF WORK?
COME TO THE HOUSE NOW

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.265
LEND ME MONEY.

00:14:12.184 --> 00:14:15.771
Seriously, I'm such an idiot.

00:14:16.272 --> 00:14:17.356
OKAY, I'LL COME.

00:14:17.439 --> 00:14:19.900
HOW MUCH DO YOU NEED THIS MONTH?

00:14:24.655 --> 00:14:25.656
Top of the morning.

00:14:26.448 --> 00:14:28.784
Thanks for the TV time last night.

00:14:31.078 --> 00:14:31.912
Sure.

00:14:37.626 --> 00:14:40.754
Hey, don't peak into another person's room
just 'cause it's open.

00:14:42.131 --> 00:14:42.965
What?

00:14:43.048 --> 00:14:44.717
Is she dead?!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:47.887
Lady Mizuki, you'll catch a cold
if you sleep there like that.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.471
- Wake up!
- Sleep?

00:14:50.347 --> 00:14:51.181
Oh.

00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:53.893
Now that I'm looking,
there are tons of beer cans…

00:14:56.437 --> 00:14:58.105
It's Kotaro!

00:14:59.356 --> 00:15:00.566
How cute.

00:15:01.358 --> 00:15:04.945
Neighbor, could you attend to
Lady Mizuki for a bit?

00:15:05.029 --> 00:15:05.863
What?

00:15:05.946 --> 00:15:07.323
To the convenience store.

00:15:08.365 --> 00:15:11.035
Hey, don't go there by yourself.

00:15:11.118 --> 00:15:12.745
Shopping?

00:15:12.828 --> 00:15:15.497
Don't mind me. Go on ahead!

00:15:19.168 --> 00:15:20.252
Hey!

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:23.088
What's wrong?

00:15:23.964 --> 00:15:26.634
Going to the convenience store suddenly…

00:15:27.384 --> 00:15:28.928
- We need to apply ice.
- What?

00:15:29.011 --> 00:15:30.346
We need to apply it quickly.

00:15:38.562 --> 00:15:39.688
Are you crying--

00:15:39.772 --> 00:15:40.731
I'm not crying.

00:15:40.814 --> 00:15:41.649
Come on.

00:15:41.732 --> 00:15:43.067
I don't like crying.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:44.526
Hey!

00:15:47.154 --> 00:15:48.697
Welcome back!

00:15:49.239 --> 00:15:51.659
It's a frozen plastic bottle!

00:15:51.742 --> 00:15:53.619
You bought this for me?

00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:56.830
You can wrap a towel around it and use it.

00:15:57.581 --> 00:15:58.874
A towel?

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.501
To cool your eyes.

00:16:00.584 --> 00:16:03.253
After crying a lot,
it's better to cool them quickly.

00:16:04.088 --> 00:16:05.047
Cried?

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.298
Doesn't look like it.

00:16:06.799 --> 00:16:08.759
She just looks like a cute drunk.

00:16:08.842 --> 00:16:11.470
No, Kotaro.

00:16:11.553 --> 00:16:13.222
I wasn't crying.

00:16:13.305 --> 00:16:16.308
I wonder if I'm a crying drunk?

00:16:17.142 --> 00:16:18.644
I don't remember a thing.

00:16:19.311 --> 00:16:20.437
I don't mind it.

00:16:21.563 --> 00:16:24.400
I won't dislike you,
even if you were crying.

00:16:26.193 --> 00:16:27.653
It's not wrong to cry.

00:16:32.116 --> 00:16:32.950
I see.

00:16:34.827 --> 00:16:37.371
Thank you, Kotaro.

00:16:40.249 --> 00:16:42.042
Well, sorry to have bothered you.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:49.758
Was it obvious from my eyes
that I was crying?

00:16:51.135 --> 00:16:52.553
I don't like crying.

00:16:53.887 --> 00:16:54.722
Hey.

00:16:55.347 --> 00:16:57.558
How did you know she had been crying?

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.812
And normally a kid wouldn't know
to apply a cold pack on eyes.

00:17:04.481 --> 00:17:08.694
I have witnessed
adults crying quite often.

00:17:12.156 --> 00:17:14.658
A popular man has many burdens.

00:17:18.537 --> 00:17:22.291
OUTDATED MANGA ARTIST/
IS IT A LIE OR THE TRUTH?

00:17:24.001 --> 00:17:25.085
Pesky birds...

00:17:25.169 --> 00:17:27.963
Can't you at least
clean up your own droppings?

00:17:38.057 --> 00:17:39.183
What was that?

00:17:39.725 --> 00:17:41.185
Karino, so…

00:17:41.268 --> 00:17:42.102
Yes.

00:17:42.186 --> 00:17:45.355
I've been thinking this
since you won our manga award…

00:17:46.065 --> 00:17:48.275
Your drawings are unfortunate.

00:17:48.358 --> 00:17:50.778
Huh? Unfortunate? What?

00:17:50.861 --> 00:17:54.531
I think the story is good
and fits with current trends,

00:17:55.115 --> 00:17:59.495
but the drawings
aren't up to par with the story.

00:17:59.578 --> 00:18:02.206
In other words,
your drawings are old-school.

00:18:02.289 --> 00:18:03.248
Haha.

00:18:03.332 --> 00:18:06.335
I don't like this style of drawing much.

00:18:06.418 --> 00:18:08.087
Just kidding. Haha.

00:18:24.228 --> 00:18:25.854
This is not a big deal.

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:29.233
Well then, Karino,
do work on your drawings.

00:18:30.067 --> 00:18:31.485
Thank you.

00:18:35.823 --> 00:18:37.950
My drawings are old-school?

00:18:38.033 --> 00:18:39.701
That low-key sucks to hear.

00:18:42.037 --> 00:18:43.038
I need coffee.

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:47.793
My lower back…

00:18:49.378 --> 00:18:52.172
This is the worst. It really is.

00:18:52.798 --> 00:18:54.216
I need an Icy Hot patch…

00:18:55.467 --> 00:18:57.511
I can't right now.

00:18:57.594 --> 00:18:59.721
Neighbor, it's me.

00:18:59.805 --> 00:19:00.639
Huh?

00:19:01.223 --> 00:19:02.641
The door isn't locked.

00:19:05.269 --> 00:19:06.562
Why, hello.

00:19:06.645 --> 00:19:08.355
Your face is closer than usual.

00:19:09.148 --> 00:19:10.065
What do you want?

00:19:10.691 --> 00:19:11.608
Okay.

00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:13.068
Look at this.

00:19:13.152 --> 00:19:14.653
Band-Aids?

00:19:14.736 --> 00:19:17.156
I just tripped in the hallway.

00:19:17.239 --> 00:19:18.699
That was that sound.

00:19:18.782 --> 00:19:20.701
You really put a lot on there.

00:19:21.243 --> 00:19:23.829
So, you fell again today
and got scraped up?

00:19:23.912 --> 00:19:28.625
Yes. Thereby, I properly
disinfected myself and applied these.

00:19:28.709 --> 00:19:29.543
I see.

00:19:29.626 --> 00:19:31.003
- How is it?
- Huh?

00:19:31.587 --> 00:19:35.674
I disinfected myself,
knowing it would sting.

00:19:35.757 --> 00:19:37.217
Well, yeah…

00:19:37.301 --> 00:19:40.345
I knew it would sting,
and sure enough, it did.

00:19:40.429 --> 00:19:41.638
I see…

00:19:41.722 --> 00:19:43.432
- So how is it?
- How's what?

00:19:43.515 --> 00:19:47.227
Did you actually want me to praise you?

00:19:47.311 --> 00:19:50.314
Don't say it out loud.
You will make me blush.

00:19:50.397 --> 00:19:52.816
You shouldn't be so insensitive.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:55.777
You came over here just for that…

00:19:55.861 --> 00:19:57.279
Hmm. What do you mean?

00:19:57.362 --> 00:20:00.866
Until now, I was very fearful
of disinfecting myself

00:20:00.949 --> 00:20:03.660
and had my hands full
just with applying the bandages.

00:20:03.744 --> 00:20:05.245
Very fearful?

00:20:05.329 --> 00:20:07.998
Then, why didn't you ask someone?

00:20:09.166 --> 00:20:10.292
Ask who?

00:20:10.375 --> 00:20:13.003
Ask who? Well, your parents--

00:20:13.587 --> 00:20:14.463
I mean…

00:20:14.546 --> 00:20:16.298
Ouch!

00:20:17.049 --> 00:20:19.968
Actually, why don't you come in for a bit?

00:20:20.052 --> 00:20:20.886
Hmm?

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.347
ICY-HOT PACK

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:24.598
I've applied it.

00:20:24.681 --> 00:20:25.807
Thanks.

00:20:27.893 --> 00:20:29.853
Could you also grab that marker?

00:20:29.937 --> 00:20:30.771
Yes.

00:20:33.148 --> 00:20:34.316
Okay, it's done.

00:20:35.317 --> 00:20:36.235
Tonosaman.

00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:39.863
A thanks for applying the patch.
Do you like these?

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:42.491
- You…
- Huh?

00:20:44.159 --> 00:20:45.702
You've done a decent job.

00:20:46.328 --> 00:20:47.454
He smiled!

00:20:48.038 --> 00:20:51.416
No, why I am surprised
by this kid's smile?

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.794
It's a normal reaction from a kid.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:57.089
But, it's the first time I've seen it.

00:20:58.298 --> 00:21:01.843
I feel kind of fired up
to work on my manga.

00:21:01.927 --> 00:21:04.680
By the way,
who is this old man you've drawn?

00:21:04.763 --> 00:21:07.182
It's not an old man. It's your face…

00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:09.977
My face is cuter than that.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.104
That's what you look like to me.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.064
Huh?

00:21:15.565 --> 00:21:17.651
No answer. Is he not home?

00:21:20.279 --> 00:21:24.408
That guy who's really ringing
your door bell, do you know him?

00:21:24.992 --> 00:21:26.576
Do you not know him?

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.246
Oh?

00:21:37.629 --> 00:21:41.091
Hey, widdle Kotaro! I stopped by to play!

00:21:41.174 --> 00:21:42.009
Widdle?

00:21:42.092 --> 00:21:45.971
Thanks so much for that tissue
you gave when you moved in!

00:21:46.054 --> 00:21:48.265
Tissue?! This guy lives here too?!

00:21:49.516 --> 00:21:50.684
Let go of me.

00:21:50.767 --> 00:21:53.812
Stop at once. Get away from me.

00:21:53.895 --> 00:21:54.938
Idiot! Stop that!

00:21:55.731 --> 00:21:58.608
Your peculiar actions are worrying me.

00:21:58.692 --> 00:22:00.193
Do not come close to me.

00:22:00.819 --> 00:22:03.822
All right, let's play in my room!

00:22:03.905 --> 00:22:06.783
Let go of me!

00:22:07.367 --> 00:22:09.119
102
TAMARU

00:22:09.202 --> 00:22:11.580
I'll give you a nice toy, Kotaro!

00:22:12.372 --> 00:22:14.541
A Tonosaman plushy!

00:22:16.209 --> 00:22:18.128
Hey, what the hell are you doing here?

00:22:18.211 --> 00:22:20.380
I'm not quite sure…

00:22:21.381 --> 00:22:23.133
I shall accept this.

00:22:23.216 --> 00:22:26.970
However, do not come closer,
occupant of Room 102.

00:22:27.054 --> 00:22:29.473
I'm Tamaru. Isamu Tamaru.

00:22:29.556 --> 00:22:33.685
You're trying to hug me
and pat my head again, aren't you?

00:22:33.769 --> 00:22:36.646
What's wrong with that? I like kids.

00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:37.647
You may not.

00:22:37.731 --> 00:22:41.943
The kid's probably not used to
physical contact beyond the bare minimum.

00:22:42.736 --> 00:22:45.614
Well, I'm just glad you liked the gift.

00:22:46.198 --> 00:22:48.283
I was about to throw it away.

00:22:48.992 --> 00:22:50.243
Why did you buy it?

00:22:50.327 --> 00:22:51.787
Well,

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:54.247
I actually bought it for my son.

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:57.751
But it seems like he hates me.

00:22:59.795 --> 00:23:02.047
I was told he didn't want to see me…

00:23:03.924 --> 00:23:06.510
So, in the end, I couldn't give it to him.

00:23:09.971 --> 00:23:12.599
So, I am a replacement for your son?

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:24.569
Then, I don't want it.
I don't want it if it's for someone else.

00:23:25.445 --> 00:23:26.947
I don't want that.

00:23:27.572 --> 00:23:30.158
I'm not happy with something that's a lie.

00:23:34.204 --> 00:23:35.288
You're right.

00:23:37.124 --> 00:23:38.041
I'm sorry.

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:46.591
Neighbor.

00:23:46.675 --> 00:23:47.717
What is it?

00:23:47.801 --> 00:23:51.763
Those drawings you drew on my bandages,

00:23:52.722 --> 00:23:53.932
were they a lie too?

00:23:55.434 --> 00:23:56.935
Do you think it's a lie?

00:23:57.769 --> 00:24:00.897
Then, what about your smile earlier?

00:24:01.565 --> 00:24:02.482
Was that a lie?

00:24:03.567 --> 00:24:07.320
I put a lot of thought into
drawing those for you.

00:24:14.161 --> 00:24:15.120
It wasn't a lie!

00:24:22.878 --> 00:24:24.087
How impudent.

00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:26.756
Don't become full of yourself.

00:24:30.594 --> 00:24:32.512
Slash!

00:24:33.096 --> 00:24:37.142
Super strong and super kind

00:24:37.225 --> 00:24:41.271
Tonosaman

00:24:41.897 --> 00:24:45.525
I am strong

00:24:45.609 --> 00:24:50.363
Tonosaman
